WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.190
Unit fifteen. Safe Water Play!

2
00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:08.044
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:11.463
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:15.229
Today we learn about Safe Water Play. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.307
Swim. Say it with me. Swim!

6
00:00:22.826 --> 00:00:26.192
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

7
00:00:29.692 --> 00:00:32.875
Pond. Say it with me. Pond!

8
00:00:36.383 --> 00:00:39.716
River. Say it with me. River!

9
00:00:43.215 --> 00:00:47.549
Life jacket. Say it with me. Life jacket!

10
00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:54.494
Rules. Say it with me. Rules!

11
00:00:57.977 --> 00:01:00.811
Deep. Say it with me. Deep!

12
00:01:04.311 --> 00:01:07.527
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:19.726
I only swim when an adult is watching. I never play alone near a pond, river, or deep water. I wear a life jacket on a boat and follow the rules.

14
00:01:19.776 --> 00:01:20.996
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.338 --> 00:01:27.455
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.505 --> 00:01:28.655
Pond!

17
00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:34.486
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.536 --> 00:01:35.686
Deep!

19
00:01:36.371 --> 00:01:43.741
Did you know? Drowning can happen quickly and quietly, so an adult should always watch children near water!

20
00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:45.865
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.538 --> 00:01:54.836
Think and answer. Why must an adult watch when children swim?

22
00:01:54.886 --> 00:01:56.036
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.297 --> 00:02:02.360
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:05.084
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

